===Return the Coreflame and complete the final "Era Nova"{{subst:void|<!--104367703-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Universal Matrix" Great Tomb of the Nameless Titan|update|Amphoreus! I do not beckon your name in haste.<br />I come here to tell a tale of history.<br />When the black tide of doom descended upon Earth, gods fell into madness, and mortals turned against each other.<br />Yet there were Flame-Chasing heroes, pioneering the great enterprise of creating a world.<br /><br />In this world, they shall meld burning golden blood into their bodies.<br />Will the destiny of days to come remember their names?<br /><br />In the name of Worldbearing, I promise you: Kephale will never forget.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Cyrene:''' "All shall bid farewell to one, and that person alone will witness the miracle. Such is the will of fate."
:'''Cyrene:''' But this time... it will be the final Flame-Chase Journey...
:'''Cyrene:''' The epic with endless cycles is about to end.
:'''Dan Heng:''' The extrapolations of the Erudition, the Coreflames of the Destruction, and the textures of the Remembrance... the Three Paths converge once again at the world's end.
:'''Dan Heng:''' And "the Trailblaze" will write a new beginning for this world.
:'''March 7th:''' Not only that, we'll also carry the history of all thirty million recurrences into the new world with us.
:'''March 7th:''' It wouldn't be an exaggeration to call it a miracle.
:'''(Trailblazer):''' This miracle wasn't created by just one person.
:'''(Trailblazer):''' Phainon would have long been consumed by the Coreflames if he hadn't chiseled his companions' dying wishes into his soul... And if the heroes' resolve to chase the flames had wavered, Cyrene's journey would never have begun...
:'''(Trailblazer):''' The heroes never yielded and never fell during Amphoreus's thirty million cycles...
:'''(Trailblazer):''' It was "fate" that fell instead.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Come. Let us complete the final Era Nova.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let us march toward the final battle against the Destruction.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let us carry the memory of thirty million recurrences into the future.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let us end this never-ending cycle.
